@DotnetUserManagementApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5290

### Register
POST {{DotnetUserManagementApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ana Souza",
  "email": "ana@example.com",
  "password": "senha12345"
}

### Login
POST {{DotnetUserManagementApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ana@example.com",
  "password": "senha12345"
}

### List users (protected - use token from login)
GET {{DotnetUserManagementApi_HostAddress}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer <seu-token-aqui>